# Context = docker/ (the published contract: docker build -f docker/Dockerfile docker).
# Deny-all baseline, then allow ONLY the content layers the Dockerfile COPYs:
# a stray file (notes, scratch PNGs, editor backups) can never reach an image
# layer - the allowlist IS the manifest. Patterns are unquoted (quotes are
# literal characters in .dockerignore and would match nothing).
*
!apk/
!apk/packages.txt
!audio/
!audio/README.md
!audio/relay.js
!audio/web/
!audio/web/LICENSE-jsmpeg.txt
!audio/web/audio.js
!audio/web/jsmpeg.min.js
!audio/web/layout.css
!audio/web/layout.js
!audio/web/page.css
!bin/
!bin/wtk-launch
!bin/wtk-chrome-local
!bin/wtk-xauth-seed
!healthcheck.sh
!nginx/
!nginx/render-nginx.py
!nginx/wtk.conf.template
!fonts/
!fonts/99-kasmweb-cjk.conf
!pulse/
!pulse/20-wtk-app-share.pa
!s6/
!windowing/
